// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [op-dropped]: CALL operation 'call_var' in function 'call_arg_unparsed_input' produced no statement
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [op-dropped]: CALL operation 'call_obj' in function 'call_arg_unparsed_input' produced no statement
// WARN-NOT: lossy lift [call-arg-synthesized]
// WARN-NOT: Diag Error
//
